From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Morinaga <me@gustavomorinaga.dev>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:13:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Vulkan window: F12 takes a capture only with
 PS3RECOMP_CAPTURE_KEY=1

Patch 2021's F12 asked for a pass capture in every build. A release must
have no debug hotkey, and F12 is also Steam's screenshot key, so a player
taking a Steam screenshot also wrote a capture folder. The key now asks
only when PS3RECOMP_CAPTURE_KEY is on (1, on, yes, true; the parser of
PS3RECOMP_VK_VALIDATION, rsx_vk_debug.h); unset, it does nothing. The
trigger file (PS3RECOMP_CAPTURE_TRIGGER) and rsx_vulkan_capture_request()
from code still ask for one.
---
 libs/video/rsx_vk_debug.h       | 9 +++++++++
 libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c | 7 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libs/video/rsx_vk_debug.h b/libs/video/rsx_vk_debug.h
index bf0f06d..a4b23d7 100644
--- a/libs/video/rsx_vk_debug.h
+++ b/libs/video/rsx_vk_debug.h
@@ -34,6 +34,15 @@ static inline int rsx_vk_env_flag(const char* v)
     return -1;
 }
 
+/* PS3RECOMP_CAPTURE_KEY: F12 takes a pass capture only when this is on
+ * (rsx_vk_env_flag's "1", "on", "yes", "true"); unset or anything else keeps
+ * the key free, so a release has no debug hotkey (F12 is also Steam's
+ * screenshot key). */
+static inline int rsx_vk_capture_key(const char* v)
+{
+    return rsx_vk_env_flag(v) == 1;
+}
+
 #define RSX_VK_MSG_SLOTS 256   /* distinct keys counted; later new ones only add to "other" */
 #define RSX_VK_MSG_FULL  3     /* occurrences of one key logged in full */
 
diff --git a/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c b/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c
index 993b11f..536d950 100644
--- a/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c
+++ b/libs/video/rsx_vulkan_backend.c
@@ -7880,9 +7880,14 @@ int rsx_vulkan_backend_pump_messages(void)
                                                )) {
             s_vk.resized = 1;
         }
+        /* F12 takes a capture only with PS3RECOMP_CAPTURE_KEY=1: a release has
+         * no debug hotkey, and F12 is also Steam's screenshot key. The trigger
+         * file (PS3RECOMP_CAPTURE_TRIGGER) and code still ask for one. */
         else if (e.type == SDL_KEYDOWN && e.key.keysym.sym == SDLK_F12 && !e.key.repeat &&
                  !(e.key.keysym.mod & KMOD_SHIFT)) {   /* Shift+F12 is MangoHUD's */
-            rsx_vulkan_capture_request();
+            static int key = -1;
+            if (key < 0) key = rsx_vk_capture_key(getenv("PS3RECOMP_CAPTURE_KEY"));
+            if (key) rsx_vulkan_capture_request();
         }
         else if (e.type == SDL_MOUSEWHEEL) {   /* cellPad: menus scroll with it */
             extern volatile int g_pad_mouse_wheel;
-- 
